      "text": "### \ud83e\uddbe Step 2A: ACT Action Trajectory Chunking\n**[[cookbooks/20-act-trajectory-chunking/README|Cookbook 20: ACT Trajectory Chunking \u2197]]**\n- **Architecture**: Action Chunking with C-VAE + Temporal Ensembling\n- **Action Horizon**: $H = 50$ steps with exponential temporal decay\n- **Throughput**: $50\\text{ Hz}$ live control frequency (<20 ms)\n- **Domain**: [[topics/visual-guidance-and-robotics/README|Visual Guidance Playbook]]",
