    {
      "id": "node-cb-18",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### \ud83d\udccd Step 3A: 3D Gaussian Splatting Lie SLAM\n**[[cookbooks/18-3dgs-lie-slam/README|Cookbook 18: 3DGS Lie SLAM \u2197]]**\n- **Geometry**: Continuous 3D Gaussian primitives in metric space\n- **Pose Tracking**: Analytical Lie algebra $\\mathfrak{se}(3)$ Jacobian tracking\n- **Rendering**: Real-time tile-based rasterization (>30 FPS)\n- **Domain**: [[topics/slam-and-spatial-perception/README|Spatial SLAM Playbook]]",
