    },
    {
      "id": "node-cb-08",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Step 4A: Control Barrier Function (CBF-QP)\n**[[cookbooks/08-control-barrier-filter/README|Cookbook 08: CBF-QP Safety Filter \u2197]]**\n- **Role**: Intercepts unverified VLA control vector $u_{\\text{deep}}$\n- **Filter**: Solves sub-millisecond convex QP ($<50\\ \\mu\\text{s}$)\n- **Guarantee**: Physical collision avoidance via Nagumo invariance",
      "x": 450,
      "y": -300,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-cb-10",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### \ud83c\udfaf Step 4B: Contrastive Sim2Real Alignment\n**[[cookbooks/10-contrastive-sim2real-alignment/README|Cookbook 10: Contrastive Sim2Real \u2197]]**\n- **Loss**: Supervised Contrastive (SupCon) / InfoNCE\n- **Target**: Bridges Unreal Engine 5 renders and physical camera crops\n- **Metric**: $+1.17$ cosine separation improvement",
      "x": 450,
      "y": -90,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-cb-06",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### \ud83d\udd0d Step 4C: Mechanistic Concept Bottleneck\n**[[cookbooks/06-mechanistic-cbm-attribution/README|Cookbook 06: Mechanistic CBM \u2197]]**\n- **Intervention**: Test-time human correction of intermediate visual concepts\n- **Transparency**: $100\\%$ linear attribution compliance (EU AI Act)",
